{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1315875-what-to-fill-a-magpies-swag-or-spiders-satchel-with","id":1315875,"title":"What to fill a Magpies Swag or spiders Satchel with.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-06-01T07:20:38-07:00","id":1315875,"title":"What to fill a Magpies Swag or spiders Satchel with.","content":"what to fill these fetish bags with<br /> <br /> What qualifys as advanced weaver devices?<br /> <br /> Does a Laptop, tablet, E reader, smart phone, revolver , and assault rifle work good for a spiders satchel?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 06-01-2019, 10:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-01T11:56:35-07:00","id":1315903,"title":"","content":"It's not &quot;advanced&quot; Weaver devices... just Weaver devices that work. You can put a broken gun in a Magpie's Swag, but not a functional one (making it more useful to Gnawers who are likely to want to carry around a lot of junk since they have Gifts to get around things being broken).<br /> <br /> As for what to fill it with?<br /> <br /> For most Tribes, I see these being a go to thing for ritualists. A lot of Rites have material components to them, so whatever ones they lead/participate in frequently tends to dictate a lot of what goes in the Fetish.<br /> <br /> Gnawers and Striders have a tendency to want to be able to carry around their basic essentials since they're less likely to have a solid home base to store things safely. So they're more likely to be extremely utilitarian about the contents. Whatever they want to have regardless of the circumstances. Spare clothing, water and food, fire sources, things like that.<br /> <br /> After that if a Garou is trying to do a human style job (usually Walkers but not exclusively; esp. jobs that are easier to hold despite Rage because they involve lots of time away from people), then this Fetish tends to get put to use for all the tools of the trade. Art supplies, crafting tools, assassin weapons, etc.<br /> <br /> Most characters that use firearms or other Weaver-tech are going to want to Dedicate or have Fetish versions of those tools so they don't have to worry about getting them out of the bag/satchel in a pinch. Spending two turns getting your gun out of your bag instead of having it ready to draw could mean a huge difference in a fight. Though I have seen a Spider's Satchel used by a GW sniper for all their sniper gear and rely on a Dedicated sidearm since sniping doesn't really work if you're caught without time to setup anyway. That all said, if your character has low Gnosis and wants to carry a bunch of stuff around just for the creature comforts it's a good Fetish to take.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-01T12:58:57-07:00","id":1315914,"title":"","content":"For a Corax or Returned Camazotz I think it makes you a great deal more mobile allowing you to take a lot more stuff with you.<br /> <br /> But what can you fit in a bag with 3 times as much space as it should have? <br /> <br /> Is their a fetish gun anywhere you know of?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-01T13:17:37-07:00","id":1315922,"title":"","content":"Chiminage and ritual items, as well as notebooks and maybe rations is helpful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-01T13:20:07-07:00","id":1315923,"title":"","content":"A fridge full of food, it's not in the plug so it counts as unfunctional.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","name":"Story Letter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12906_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-01T15:08:04-07:00","id":1315947,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1315875-what-to-fill-a-magpies-swag-or-spiders-satchel-with?p=1315914#post1315914\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But what can you fit in a bag with 3 times as much space as it should have?</div> </div> </div> </div>Um... three times as much as the bag holds?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Is their a fetish gun anywhere you know of? </div> </div> </div>The GW Tribebooks, and Hammer &amp; Klaive at a minimum.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Story Letter</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1315875-what-to-fill-a-magpies-swag-or-spiders-satchel-with?p=1315923#post1315923\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A fridge full of food, it's not in the plug so it counts as unfunctional.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think turning a device off works for the Fetish... otherwise the no Weaver tech thing basically doesn't work because you can turn almost anything off.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-02T00:13:36-07:00","id":1316024,"title":"","content":"ok ho much space is 3 times the space of a laptop carrying case?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p